(
    title: "Crazy Climber",
    description: Some("Scale four skyscrapers window by window while the buildings fight back — the Mad Doctor rains flowerpots and buckets, a giant condor divebombs with eggs, girders sweep the walls and windows snap shut on your hands: one caught hand survives if you freeze, two means the street. Top each tower inside the helicopter\'s thirty-second hover to fly onward; there is no climbing down. Atari sold the cart only through its mail-order fan club."),
